1. **`_textContentOf` and `_withSingleText`** — referenced in the diff but I haven't seen their definitions. They may be pre-existing (from tool spill) or new. The diff hunk ends at `UserMessageSpillGuard` but I didn't see `_textContentOf`/`_withSingleText` added in the diff. Let me check the current file.

